# Project safety

Before editing, read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/handoff/CURRENT.md`, and `docs/KNOWN-ISSUES.md`. Inspect git status and the live database; do not trust an old chat for either.

Do not seed, force-reset, or accept data loss on the live SQLite file. Do not recalculate, re-import, replace fixtures, or transition a real round unless that write was requested. Do not upgrade dependencies unless requested.

Closed rounds reject writes before parsing. Preparation rounds (`productionStartedAt` null) are excluded from due jobs and official totals. Missing saved predictions are not unsaved edits.

Commit only reviewed source. Never commit `.env`, `prisma/dev.db`, backups, or `.next/`. Do not force-push. After a behavior change, update `docs/` and `docs/handoff/CURRENT.md`.
